  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『サクラ大戦２』より、ヒロインの一人である真宮寺さくらの機体がHGから登場！",
      "en": "From \"Sakura Wars 2\", the aircraft of one of the heroines, Sakura Shinguji, is now available from HG!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 細部までこだわった造形で約125mmサイズの中に洗練された光武・改の魅力を凝縮。",
      "en": "• The charm of the sophisticated Mitsubu Kai is condensed in a size of approximately 125mm with attention to detail."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 搭乗ハッチを開閉できるギミックを搭載。コックピットに付属のフィギュアを搭乗させることが可能。",
      "en": "• Equipped with a gimmick that allows you to open and close the boarding hatch. It is possible to board the included figure in the cockpit."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• アイカメラを左右に動かせるギミックにより、ポージングに合わせた自然な視線移動を表現。",
      "en": "• A gimmick that allows the eye camera to move left and right allows for natural eye movements that match the pose."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 内部構造には版元監修のもと、プラモデルならではの新解釈を追加。",
      "en": "• Under the supervision of the publisher, a new interpretation unique to plastic models has been added to the internal structure."
    }
  ],
